{"version":1,"content":"<p>海關接獲一名內地旅客投訴，指遭藥房職員以不良手法推銷中藥，事主最終支付逾1.1萬元購買中藥粉。</p><p>海關今日（27日）到涉事位於尖沙嘴彌敦道80號的「悅康藥業」跟進調查，並拘捕一名30歲男店員，涉嫌觸犯《商品說明條例》中「誤導性遺漏」罪行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:41:40.514248+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T15:18:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T00:38:13.217619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:18.983439+00:00","content_hash":"b45496954372bcf2103c2338f5ba6c05738bc8bfad7c9e1d7193ec72221fe395","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}